.SH NAME
t_redir \- Redirection data node\&.  

.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
.PP
\fR#include <ast\&.h>\fP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Redirection data node\&. 

Stored in t_cmd\&.redirs and t_group\&.redirs as t_list* (each node->content is a t_redir*)\&. No *next field\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIfd\fP source fd (-1 = default for the operator type)\&. 
.br
\fItarget\fP raw filename or fd number string (unexpanded)\&. 
.br
\fIheredoc_delim\fP the delimiter word for << (raw, may be quoted)\&. 
.br
\fIheredoc_content\fP collected heredoc content (filled after parse, before exec)\&. 
.br
\fIheredoc_quoted\fP 1 if delimiter was quoted (no expansion inside heredoc)\&. 
.RE
.PP


